---
description: Keep Swagger schemas outside DTO classes
globs: src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Swagger Docs Convention

- Keep complex OpenAPI schemas in feature-level `swagger/` files (for example `swagger/schemas.ts`), not inline in DTO decorators.
- DTO classes should reference exported schema constants (`properties`, `items`, `additionalProperties`) to stay readable.
- Use inline schema objects in DTOs only for very small primitives.
- When a type is `Record<string, T>`, use OpenAPI `additionalProperties` with a strict schema for `T`.
